# Sample requests (VS Code "REST Client" extension or Rider/Visual Studio).
@api = http://localhost:5080

### Create a job
POST {{api}}/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://example.com", "maxDepth": 1 }

### Job status (paste the jobId from above)
GET {{api}}/api/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Tree
GET {{api}}/api/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/tree

### History (newest first; pass nextCursor to get the next page)
GET {{api}}/api/jobs?limit=20

### Cancel
POST {{api}}/api/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel

### Health
GET {{api}}/health
